.TH ZDOTS 1 "2026-11-15" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots \- DSL dispatcher root for zdots-* commands
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zdots
.I noun
.RI [ verb ]
.RI [ args... ]
.br
.B zdots
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zdots
dispatches
.BI zdots " noun " [ args... ]
to
.BI zdots- noun " " [ args... ]
(decision-008, Z-149).
All standalone
.B zdots-*
executables remain directly invocable.
.PP
When an unknown noun is given,
.B zdots
logs the miss to syslog/Unified Logging under tag
.B zdots
(Z-177) and prints matching noun suggestions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
List available nouns with descriptions (via
.BR zdots-help (1)).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
zdots status
zdots ctl up
zdots help ctx
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zdots-help (1),
.BR agent-guide (1),
.BR zdots-doctor (1)
